  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We know that, the total number of subsets of a set having <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> elements is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>56</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>  and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>Distance between <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>PQ</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>PQ</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>6</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>PQ</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>100</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>PQ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math> units</p>",
